      "id": "session:2026-10-07-9f063e5d",
      "type": "Session",
      "label": "Requirements interview and repository set-up",
      "description": "Goal: Design kg with the user acting as client, and set up the repository.\nInstructions: The user answers question blocks in a text file; the requirements come out as a Markdown document. Secrets go in `.env`, never committed.\nDiscoveries: The client wants a CLI for humans and agents that turns a project's knowledge into a queryable graph; open questions PA-01 to PA-03 were settled (name `kg`, stable IDs, HTML with vis.js through pyvis).\nAccomplished: Agent folder layout created; requirements and the interview summary written; repo initialised and pushed; MVP issues #1 to #12 opened; #1 (CLI skeleton) implemented in PR #13.\nNext steps: Review and merge PR #13, then #2 (JSON Schema).\nRelevant files: docs/requirements.md, docs/discovery.md, AGENTS.md, src/kg/cli.py",
